Film stock data: the curves and spectra in core/film_data, and the tables built from them in
core/src/film_stocks.inc, are manufacturers' datasheet values as digitized by spectral_film_lut
(https://github.com/JanLohse/spectral_film_lut), Copyright (c) 2026 Jan Lohse, MIT license
(core/film_data/LICENSE-spectral_film_lut). The table generator uses colour-science
(https://github.com/colour-science/colour, BSD-3-Clause) and its ColorChecker spectra; it is
run by hand and is not part of the build.

Third-party software fetched at build time:

- OpenFX SDK (https://github.com/AcademySoftwareFoundation/openfx), BSD-3-Clause.
  The OFX headers and C++ support library are compiled into the plugin.
- JSON for Modern C++ (https://github.com/nlohmann/json), MIT. Compiled into the plugin and
  the designer to read and write looks.
- SDL 3 (https://github.com/libsdl-org/SDL), zlib license. Compiled into the designer for its
  window and input.
- Dear ImGui (https://github.com/ocornut/imgui), MIT. Compiled into the designer for its
  controls.
- Khronos OpenCL headers (https://github.com/KhronosGroup/OpenCL-Headers), Apache-2.0.
- GoogleTest (https://github.com/google/googletest), BSD-3-Clause. Used for tests only.

